Source: ocsfs
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OCSFS Project <ocsfs@example.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), uuid-dev, dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/ocsfs/ocsfs

Package: ocsfs-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, uuid-runtime
Recommends: ocsfs-dkms
Description: OCSFS userspace tools
 Open Cluster Shared FileSystem — userspace administration tools.
 .
 Includes:
  * mkfs.ocsfs — format a block device with OCSFS
  * ocsfs-tool — inspect and manage OCSFS volumes
  * ocsfs-defrag — online defragmentation daemon
  * mount.ocsfs — mount helper for mount(8)

Package: ocsfs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-$(DEB_HOST_ARCH)
Recommends: ocsfs-tools
Description: OCSFS kernel module (DKMS)
 Open Cluster Shared FileSystem — Linux kernel module built via DKMS.
 .
 Provides the ocsfs.ko kernel module for mounting OCSFS filesystems.
 The module is automatically rebuilt when new kernel versions are installed.

Package: ocsfs-proxmox
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ocsfs-tools, ocsfs-dkms, proxmox-ve | pve-manager
Description: OCSFS Proxmox VE storage plugin
 Open Cluster Shared FileSystem — Proxmox VE integration.
 .
 Provides the PVE::Storage::OCSFSPlugin storage backend, supporting
 all PVE content types (images, ISO, templates, backups, containers,
 snippets) on a single shared OCSFS datastore.
